ns.\n- Slightly reduced maximum dynamic resolution to lessen battery drain.\n- Various under-the-hood optimizations and fixes.", "created_date": 1774377710, "id": "26398249276484138", "version": "1.18", "version_code": 20, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6983921981676824", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28719852567657119"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "291378316592543"}]}, "change_log": "- Inventory menu is now visible through walls and obstacles, similar to the Pause menu.\n- Head collision with overhead objects now has smooth push-back, like other player collisions.\n- Appearance of 'splatter' particle effects has been improved for all lighting conditions.\n- Gate now has better physics interaction with dynamic objects when it opens.", "created_date": 1763494378, "id": "25277835468525530", "version": "1.17", "version_code": 19, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6983921981676824", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28719852567657119"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "291378316592543"}]}, "change_log": "- Patched to address Unity vulnerability.\n- Some particle effects have been tweaked for more consistent color and lighting.", "created_date": 1759862535, "id": "24873673398941741", "version": "1.16", "version_code": 18, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}